[% USE wrap -%]
[% text = "The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs. How vexingly quick daft zebras jump!" -%]
[% FOREACH w IN [10, 20, 33, 72] -%]
--[% w %]--
[% wrap(text, w) %]
[% wrap(text, w, '  * ', '    ') %]
[% END -%]
[% FILTER wrap(30, '> ', '> ') %]
Paragraph one has	a tab and   several   spaces inside it.


Paragraph two follows two blank lines and ends with spaces.   
[% END %]
[% wrap('Supercalifragilisticexpialidocious-and-more-hyphenated-words here', 15) %]
[% wrap("short", 40) %]|
[% wrap("line one\nline two that is a bit longer than the width\n\nafter blank", 20, '', "\t") %]
[% wrap("crlf line\r\nnext line", 8) %]
[%+ wrap("   leading spaces then words", 12) %]|
[% wrap("trailing newlines\n\n\n", 30) %]|
